# Worktrees live inside the checkout they belong to. Git skips a REGISTERED
# one, but not a directory left behind by a worktree whose repo has moved or
# been renamed: that becomes an ordinary untracked tree, and a whole second
# copy of the source turns up as hundreds of files staged into this one.
.worktrees/
